   "n": 41,
   "html": "Qual destes ângulos é um <b>ângulo reto</b>?<svg class=\"ill\" width=\"400\" height=\"118\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 118\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 90 h80 M20 90 l60 -55\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M45 90 a25 25 0 0 0 -6 -17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e5506a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M150 90 h80 M150 90 v-70\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M150 72 h18 v18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e5506a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M300 90 h80 M300 90 l-40 -60\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M325 90 a25 25 0 0 0 -39 -21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e5506a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"55\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">A</text><text x=\"185\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">B</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">C</text></svg><span class=\"choice\" data-a=\"1\" data-t=\"ch\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"0\">A</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"1\">B</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"opt\" data-v=\"2\">C</button></span>",
