  {
   "n": 42,
   "html": "Clique nos quadradinhos do lado direito para completar a figura <b>simétrica</b>. A linha vermelha funciona como um espelho.<div class=\"sym\" data-cells=\"1,3;2,2;2,3;3,1;3,2;3,3;4,2;4,3;5,3;0,3\" data-cols=\"8\" data-rows=\"7\" data-axis=\"4\" data-t=\"sym\"></div>",
   "gab": "Quadradinhos espelhados do lado direito"
  },
  {
   "n": 43,
   "html": "Classifique cada par de retas:<svg class=\"ill\" width=\"380\" height=\"96\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 96\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M10 20 l90 0 M10 50 l90 0\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M180 10 v60 M150 40 h60\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M270 15 l80 50 M270 60 l80 -40\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"92\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">A</text><text x=\"175\" y=\"92\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">B</text><text x=\"305\" y=\"92\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">C</text></svg><div class=\"grid\"><div>A) <select class=\"sel\" data-a=\"paralelas\" data-t=\"s\"><option value=\"\">escolha</option><option value=\"paralelas\">paralelas</option><option value=\"perpendiculares\">perpendiculares</option><option value=\"concorrentes\">concorrentes</option></select></div><div>B) <select class=\"sel\" data-a=\"perpendiculares\" data-t=\"s\"><option value=\"\">escolha</option><option value=\"paralelas\">paralelas</option><option value=\"perpendiculares\">perpendiculares</option><option value=\"concorrentes\">concorrentes</option></select></div><div>C) <select class=\"sel\" data-a=\"concorrentes\" data-t=\"s\"><option value=\"\">escolha</option><option value=\"paralelas\">paralelas</option><option value=\"perpendiculares\">perpendiculares</option><option value=\"concorrentes\">concorrentes</option></select></div></div>",
   "gab": "A paralelas · B perpendiculares · C concorrentes"
  },
  {
   "n": 44,
   "html": "Observe o cubo e complete:<div class=\"row\"><svg class=\"ill\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\" viewBox=\"0 0 110 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M10 30 l43.3 -25.0 l43.3 25.0 l-43.3 25.0 Z\" fill=\"#ffe1c2\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><path d=\"M10 30 l43.3 25.0 l0 50 l-43.3 -25.0 Z\" fill=\"#F07E26\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><path d=\"M53.3 55.0 l43.3 -25.0 l0 50 l-43.3 25.0 Z\" fill=\"#b5560f\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/></svg><div class=\"grid\"><div>Faces: <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"6\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:44px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>Vértices: <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"8\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:44px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>Arestas: <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"12\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:44px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div></div></div>",
